Chapter: ReflMismatch

 Refl proves a === a only. Claiming Integer === Text and offering Refl
 must be rejected: the unifier binds the equality's first component to
 Integer, then must reject Text against it on the second component
 (CDX2001). This regression-guards the PropEqTy unification fix.

Section: Bad Proof

  refl-bad : Integer === Text
  refl-bad = Refl

Section: Main

  opening : [Console] Nothing
  opening = act
   print-line-uni "unreachable"
  end
